                                "sense_id": "fba5cf2b-b161-3290-8630-36c6878ae235",
                                "text": "General Sickles's butler was not to be found anywhere on the premises, as he was already out and about, attempting to find a suitable strawhat that might lend credence to the boy's Amish upbringing."
